    - target: {fileID: 3041435764904491832, guid: 3313aeb27968edb48b9e46977d5d9c6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nReason for this game even happening:\nThank you stardance for making
        the stardance challenge\nits the reason why this game is even here right
        now.\n\nIdea for the game:\nHugo Virtanen (me)\n\nGraphic designing and 3D
        models:\nHugo Virtanen\n\nInspiration:\nBackrooms(not the movie)\n and liminal
        spaces\n\nCredits for playtester:\nThank you Marcus for playtesting\nand
        giving good feedback for LASTSIGNAL\n\nThank YOU for playing LASTSIGNAL!\nI
        hope you enjoyed the game and give an nice review in\nStardance :O!\n\nSpecial
        thanks for support:\nThank you Silvonik for supporting\nme from the early
        days of LASTSIGNAL!\nAnd also for playtesting LASTSIGNAL\nif you liked this,
        go check out\nSilvonik's projects!\n\nSupport and assistance in the early
        days:\nSuklaasukkulaYT\nAlso check out KuuppaOS!\n\nScripting:\nHugo Virtanen\n\nStoryline
        and characters:\nHugo Virtanen\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
